#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:6
msgid "Running Isaac Lab in Docker"
msgstr "在 Docker 中运行 Isaac Lab"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Docker packages Isaac Lab and its dependencies into a reusable environment. "
"``docker/container.py`` is the main entry point for running Isaac Lab in a "
"container. It wraps ``docker compose`` so that you do not have to remember "
"which Dockerfile, environment files, and volume mounts belong together -- "
"you name a *profile*, and the script assembles the rest."
msgstr ""
"Docker 将 Isaac Lab 及其依赖打包为可复用环境。 ``docker/container.py`` 是在容器中运行 Isaac Lab "
"的主要入口。它封装 ``docker compose`` ，无需记住哪些 Dockerfile、环境文件和卷挂载应搭配使用；只需指定一种 "
"*配置*，脚本会组装其余内容。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"The image it builds is also the basis for the other workflows: "
":ref:`deployment-cluster` converts it to an Apptainer image, and "
":ref:`docker-cloud-cloud` provisions a machine that runs it."
msgstr ""
"构建的镜像也是其他工作流的基础： :ref:`deployment-cluster` 将其转换为 Apptainer 镜像， :ref:`docker-"
"cloud-cloud` 配置运行它的机器。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"The standard Isaac Lab container depends on the Isaac Sim Docker image. By "
"running that container, you are implicitly agreeing to the `NVIDIA Software "
"License Agreement`_. If you do not agree to the EULA, do not run that "
"container. The ``kitless`` image contains neither Isaac Sim nor Kit."
msgstr ""
"标准 Isaac Lab 容器依赖 Isaac Sim Docker 镜像。运行该容器即表示默认同意 `NVIDIA 软件许可协议 <NVIDIA "
"Software License Agreement_>`_ 。如果不同意 EULA，请勿运行。 ``kitless`` 镜像不包含 Isaac Sim"
" 或 Kit。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:23
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"Install `Docker Engine <https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/>`__, `Docker"
" Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`__, and the `NVIDIA "
"Container Toolkit <https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-"
"native/container-toolkit/latest/install-guide.html>`__. The container is "
"tested with Docker Engine 26.0.0 and Docker Compose 2.25.0; use these "
"versions or newer. Follow the `post-installation steps`_ so that Docker runs"
" without ``sudo``."
msgstr ""
"安装 `Docker Engine <https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/>`__ 、 `Docker "
"Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`__ 和 `NVIDIA Container "
"Toolkit <https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-native/container-"
"toolkit/latest/install-guide.html>`__ 。容器已使用 Docker Engine 26.0.0 和 Docker "
"Compose 2.25.0 测试，请使用这些或更新版本。完成 `安装后步骤 <post-installation steps_>`_ ，使 "
"Docker 无需 ``sudo`` 即可运行。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"The Isaac Sim documentation on `container installation`_ covers the same "
"prerequisites in more detail, including how to obtain access to the Isaac "
"Sim image."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 的 `容器安装 <container installation_>`_ 文档更详细地介绍了同样的前置要求，包括如何获得 Isaac "
"Sim 镜像访问权限。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"Due to limitations with `snap <https://snapcraft.io/docs/home-outside-"
"home>`_, please make sure the Isaac Lab directory is placed under the "
"``/home`` directory tree when using docker."
msgstr ""
"由于对 `snap <https://snapcraft.io/docs/home-outside-home>`_ 的限制，请确保 Isaac Lab "
"目录位于 ``/home`` 目录树下使用 docker 时。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:40
msgid "Container profiles"
msgstr "容器配置"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"A profile is a `Docker Compose profile <https://docs.docker.com/compose/how-"
"tos/profiles/>`__: ``docker-compose.yaml`` tags each service with one, and "
"Compose starts only the services whose profile is active. Naming a profile "
"therefore selects a matched set -- one service, one Dockerfile, one set of "
"environment files, and one image name:"
msgstr ""
"这里的配置是 `Docker Compose profile <https://docs.docker.com/compose/how-"
"tos/profiles/>`__ ： ``docker-compose.yaml`` 为每个服务标记一种 profile，Compose 只启动已启用"
" profile 对应的服务。因此，指定配置名会选择配套的一组内容：一个服务、一个 Dockerfile、一组环境文件和一个镜像名。"

