#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:72
msgid ""
"Every command below takes the profile as its first positional argument and "
"defaults to ``base``. Only one profile applies at a time, and the resulting "
"image and container are both named ``isaac-lab-<profile>``. Pass "
"``--suffix`` to append a name suffix when you want several variants of the "
"same profile side by side. Do not use ``--suffix`` with cluster deployments,"
" whose export commands expect the unsuffixed image name."
msgstr ""
"下文各命令的第一个位置参数是配置名，默认为 ``base`` 。一次只应用一种配置，生成镜像与容器均名为 ``isaac-lab-<profile>``"
" 。如果希望并行保留同一配置的多个变体，传入 ``--suffix`` 添加名称后缀。集群部署的导出命令要求无后缀镜像名，因此不要使用 "
"``--suffix`` 。"

