#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:101
msgid ""
"The script writes simulation time at each step to "
"``/workspace/isaaclab/logs/docker_tutorial/log.txt``. Stop the script with "
"``Ctrl+C`` and type ``exit`` to return to the host shell. Retrieve the "
"results before stopping the container:"
msgstr ""
"脚本将每步仿真时间写入 ``/workspace/isaaclab/logs/docker_tutorial/log.txt`` 。按 "
"``Ctrl+C`` 停止脚本，输入 ``exit`` 返回宿主机 shell。停止容器前取回结果："

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:111
msgid ""
"The log is now at ``docker/artifacts/logs/docker_tutorial/log.txt`` on the "
"host. The ``stop`` command removes the container and its Compose-managed "
"volumes, including logs and caches; copy out anything you need first. The "
"image remains. To remove it after stopping, run ``docker image rm isaac-lab-"
"base``; the next ``start`` rebuilds it. See `Docker pruning "
"<https://docs.docker.com/engine/manage-resources/pruning/>`__ for other "
"cleanup options."
msgstr ""
"日志现位于宿主机的 ``docker/artifacts/logs/docker_tutorial/log.txt`` 。 ``stop`` "
"命令删除容器及其 Compose 管理的卷，包括日志和缓存，因此应先复制所需内容。镜像会保留；停止后如需删除，运行 ``docker image rm "
"isaac-lab-base`` ，下次 ``start`` 会重新构建。其他清理方式见 `Docker 清理 "
"<https://docs.docker.com/engine/manage-resources/pruning/>`__ 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:0
msgid "Code for log_time.py"
msgstr "log_time.py 的代码"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:125
msgid ""
"The image copies the repository to ``/workspace/isaaclab`` at build time, so"
" edits made after the build are not picked up automatically. To keep the "
"development loop fast, the compose file bind-mounts ``source``, ``scripts``,"
" ``docs``, and ``tools`` from the host, so changes to those directories "
"appear inside the container immediately. Everything else requires a rebuild."
msgstr ""
"镜像在构建时将仓库复制到 ``/workspace/isaaclab`` ，因此不会自动包含构建后的修改。为加快开发迭代，Compose "
"文件从宿主机绑定挂载 ``source`` 、 ``scripts`` 、 ``docs`` 和 ``tools`` "
"，这些目录的修改会立即出现在容器内。其他内容需要重新构建。"

