#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:200
msgid "What persists between runs"
msgstr "运行之间保留的内容"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:202
msgid ""
"The compose file declares named volumes for Isaac Sim caches, logs, and your"
" own data. They remain available while reusing a container, but "
"``container.py stop`` runs ``docker compose down --volumes`` and removes "
"them. Run ``container.py copy`` before ``stop`` to preserve your results on "
"the host."
msgstr ""
"Compose 文件为 Isaac Sim 缓存、日志和用户数据声明命名卷。复用容器时，这些卷保持可用；但 ``container.py stop`` "
"会运行 ``docker compose down --volumes`` 并删除它们。先运行 ``container.py copy`` ，再运行 "
"``stop`` ，以将结果保存到宿主机。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:207
msgid ""
"``container.py copy`` extracts the three volumes you are most likely to want"
" on the host -- ``logs``, ``data_storage``, and ``docs/_build`` -- into "
"``docker/artifacts``. For anything else, use ``docker cp``, for example "
"``docker cp isaac-lab-base:/workspace/isaaclab/logs .``."
msgstr ""
"``container.py copy`` 将最常需要的三个卷——``logs`` 、 ``data_storage`` 和 "
"``docs/_build``——提取到宿主机 ``docker/artifacts`` 。其他内容使用 ``docker cp`` ，例如 "
"``docker cp isaac-lab-base:/workspace/isaaclab/logs .`` 。"

