#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:275
msgid ""
"Run ``docker volume ls`` on the host to find the actual names, which include"
" the Compose project prefix, then use ``docker volume inspect <volume-"
"name>``. The ``kitless`` profile uses the uv and Warp caches and shares the "
"documentation, logs, and data volumes with the others."
msgstr ""
"在宿主机运行 ``docker volume ls`` ，查找带有 Compose 项目前缀的实际名称，再用 ``docker volume "
"inspect <volume-name>`` 查看。 ``kitless`` 配置使用 uv 和 Warp 缓存，并与其他配置共享文档、日志和数据卷。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:280
msgid "Display forwarding with X11"
msgstr "通过 X11 转发显示"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:282
msgid ""
"X11 forwarding lets GUI applications started inside the container display on"
" the host. The first ``start`` asks whether to enable it and records the "
"answer in ``docker/.container.cfg``. To change it later, set "
"``X11_FORWARDING_ENABLED`` to ``0`` or ``1`` in that file and run ``start`` "
"again -- the rebuild is what applies the change."
msgstr ""
"X11 转发使容器内启动的图形应用显示在宿主机上。首次 ``start`` 会询问是否启用，并将答案记录在 "
"``docker/.container.cfg`` 。以后如需修改，将该文件的 ``X11_FORWARDING_ENABLED`` 设为 ``0`` "
"或 ``1`` ，再运行 ``start`` ；修改在重新构建时生效。"

#: source/workflows/docker/index.rst:181
msgid ""
"The CloudXR sidecar example below is retained from the Isaac Lab 2.x "
"workflow. For Isaac Lab 3.0 teleoperation, use the single-container setup in"
" :ref:`cloudxr-teleoperation`, which starts CloudXR automatically. Do not "
"use the legacy Compose patch for the current teleoperation workflow."
msgstr ""
"以下 CloudXR 独立配套容器示例沿用 Isaac Lab 2.x 工作流。Isaac Lab 3.0 遥操作应使用 :ref:`cloudxr-"
"teleoperation` 中的单容器配置，由它自动启动 CloudXR。当前遥操作工作流不要使用旧的 Compose 补丁。"
